  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "久旱三年，草木不生。粢盛空乏，無以供靈。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d909b5d37bd12c21c9b9d246d8ce07008a4e52265c7b7e135120f06b8ba48f8d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ccd36b2c26fc8529c1b3fbc25150caaf2bced2cd8d9e9bff59265e1012dbd203"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "火滅復息，君明其德。仁人可遇，身受利祿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e79a407e0f841c845f1b2a956559742630d4c0cb2044bde04aa861630833aa7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4710933f48ddc45fdb4b28da72ed2d2ae94e41144377a70bab1c6b1f88429e5a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "溫山松柏，常茂不落。鸞鳳所庇，得其歡樂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f3ca46c07cba407d84578e988a396320084c5ea2e8f686b17adaf60a7759b93c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9279dd08a4833cb3f6347bf412545c435711275cccae8629d7e4e51bf5095c47"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "四誅不服，恃強負力。倍道趨敵，師徒敗覆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d4b93709c667d80150c8e124d585881bc052f0caf2f81d367a5e5b0bb11cf9ad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b7600627a60ef4d70d95efceeebae7c257cdb3362d1ed70ed22b30ea8b0697d0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "三塗五岳，陽城大室。神明之保，獨無兵革。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd13f445f924295350e50f7f40e392f955d90c04b2e247a261ddce788e275868",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0ed1bb7ee89fb901d4b1772aec8a57465b3dcf3989aec3a473964e8fb1534d62"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "三年生狗，以戍其母。荊夷上侵，姬伯出走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d88bd6da27d723ca67359e37cdf4f280fde3ef714420302fadc929152f1ef8f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:acd5df107ae1c340653dd883175a24ca194c5836b748cf734331ed38020a7175"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "鳧遊江海，沒行千里。以為死亡，復見空桑。長生樂鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:093f4b1bf5f341414b3b7c7115823f3792299a1083211fb636d401eb9210d112",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:41daef7f31abe3e8748131abd66556923db739c350004cbf82c808df2b31ff1d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "太乙駕騮，從天上來。徵君叔季，封為魯侯。無有凶憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ce5196996be77efbd8d15efeb7d5560ebb272aabe4e9857a3d0ecf0e6d8335c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:765c43a6016b13c391bd40ae2a40f6e10d060d7d14a0bdf10c032fa903d85b60"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "任宿獨居，寡處無夫。陰陽失志，為人僕使。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3a9594decae3bc1bac6fc2000414b4543a1a4339a5aa615d92af8c74e4b6b46f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:abbfcc0567c1bc42a31a9ac94a4fd382975dd3f3f07d575119ba11b145119bb8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "兵征大宛，北至玉關。與胡寇戰，平城道西。七日絕糧，身幾不全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:37581e4876b29551151a7dd4f1bfe585f980c9807436a2702d1ae5451390b4bc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c48c024ebbb131114c915c9e29371acc2ef68e0a7761ce009235eae40322435d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "楚靈暴虐，罷及民力。禍起乾溪，棄疾作毒。扶杖奔逃，身死仄室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0757e9e3f7e3afe95e35941f4b74b88718ac554cba1d0f18fa864d9979cc7c5a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a78979b9f68f90cb8c49d7fb3b29537b8903ca63f6f1a37d0e491328c816dc3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "雌單獨居，歸其本巢。毛羽憔悴，志如死灰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:143c3e5d235f5a5478cd5fddedc7dce9fffabd2bf35433f5559e5060047d9869",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a17e0b486a7f5fc17646d6bda421cc8055c387be124f34e993b44227cd7bf88"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "兩矛相刺，勇力鈞敵。交援結和，不破不缺。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:86ec184fa15c0dc328ab46bb941313f216b5a68a9021b54eaeb7afdc9d3dffa0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:287981ca083390c730bc2ed845ba7191be4c500ad2f266dc0a33085a1e8203ff"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "乘船濟渡，載水逢火。賴行免禍，蒙我生全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:897891b17bd08df144ce98eb41a71615060e1a44f1812fc9b2b95f90cbb6df7d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:adff55a84394bb170a7cd97e8145e088694d4ffb01db67f9acea2a5650be9bc4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "喪寵益尤，政傾家覆。我宗失國，秦滅周室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:40bc34b83dac57a0c4afdac7fb67bb78e78581a29227245b3effb3a781e5ab44",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:225960617475c1ed44ab34165d6bdffcb66f48f71d2b008fe66c15971f77f9fd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "冬無藏冰，春江不通。陰流為賊，國被其殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dc1b97af74195b8362b346e73621611e83ca9451bd7dc7fddaba19a3141b73ba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39faae0ab26ae15c56a1b7775a0e647099380518ce27a869cdac0e5cb883743d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "田鼠野雞，意常欲逃。拘制籠檻，不得動搖。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:09aa209fd9cb07ce091fd274d3bbd4f58cd5fcaa8aa0c4d728d530e5cfce1b28",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0dd401497cc31715ea20a4c3241d3f473c048d48aba0dfc91ad3660ee323fcfe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "佩玉藻兮，無所繫之。旨酒一盛，莫與笑語。孤寡獨特，常愁憂苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:00067d4808cfc9c101b0742c3965b64449fdc8c830dc8676833e62664af38022",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7d459ead63c055d7f1ac5d60ea09c47c4a6642db63b9ec132c2a1eaf869bd39c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "沒游源口，求鮫為室。家危自懼，復出生道。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:976a209f1a86e47f62fc1ab8fb1129e7a78ff01b30b8a2e6f37cf18b836df0ae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d72e362d19307c9bf76f4696dd1a85633272732a72b20140c2bad469c6875180"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "河水孔穴，壞敗我室。水深無岸，魚鱉傾倒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c717328bfe3c4dfdf08833f147e448a7a51748ba410a232c32d9cd95f4f01ac5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cc48bcbc54cda33e8c5fb924c561fa181eb392128842ce0d589d36a5c1093c7b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "教羊牧兔，使魚捕鼠。任非其人，費日無功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:599b708353cb8ca56ef58a6d17570925855c788b2de408bd8d02489dc2935603",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9f613500f101fb5099e438faeb614b8ecaa364a35bad3fec56b2a7d24d306552"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "升戶入室，就溫煖食。冰凍北陸，寒不得賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f5c787a773745afa3acac787352f166bba522a872d2a6c107bed92162d850bbf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b024da9e1ccf3a7191af443026112fbec50d3bf80f41410ae248410e4df06a6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "孤竹之墟，失婦亡夫。傷於蒺藜，不見少妻。東郭棠姜，武氏破亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d0a0b7de88da8baa7d92f78f7d5e9da13b709df59a81af18f07bca875e5810d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b648910066ae1dd0c420d1c48cd530cfc9e96138239475ef7e03b37e7be189d4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "凶禍災殃，日益明彰。福不可釐，三郤夷傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5283698892c0be58cb9778f19a63c168097a51df29c4bf5f38b56b959ac2a9b0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:321356f03fe587326e3e464e497d13e7c749aed48dd6214f5f11c0fe53b1262a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "載璧秉珪，請命于河。周公克敏，沖人瘳愈。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f4a2722ca93149bf373b68abc1ab467feae7d0a0dbba251ab409f31245ea56ed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2c0d82155a2e925fc14a6b3a880c080f958b6d0843280f320525a8d9926440bf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "烏飛鵲舉，照臨東海。尨降庭堅，為陶叔後。圭析英雄，履福綏厚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9afb718556c0793dc10cb6fa8e45f301c0fc8e19eedcf597983e7826709763ff",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:30cf73ec9ec2a04f031266d9e6e022ebddb67c629c93cf3c0d04c03bfac30008"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "危坐至暮，請求不得。膏澤不降，政戾民惑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:17da06ab08d70f27ed45b4785e30eef24dce1ae52c91ce02be7aa84f36d2ba0e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bdef0cb0f806fba8560ef47d21b5470d68a3a33096dd48fc15fe060bf77c8310"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "宜昌娶婦，東家歌舞。宴樂有緒，長安嘉喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3131119188a0458d883a04951c758728edf7064dd7b7fa2696e63b4721711ccb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:734d6125cf1eb647703b1f233ed89f40bdbc0e50393ebe3fda4034078876d21f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "鑿井求玉，非卞氏寶。名困身辱，勞無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:89e857e135972380ad605cee15fcd51b090e14a9e1fb89752879b3989fc13d77",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f2f4df3fada0ff3e9f5155b60b0f66339b14f859c646583d93a2da4db53ec341"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "鵠思其雄，欲隨鳳東。順理羽翼，出次日中。須留比邑，復反其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:24b87219e7eb4b6cf257455faace5b382e5abc2c686855122021e419971669c8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:34b1ac5fb231dbbde354d7e58f5adf34fc34b319fe3e90089871b8783e8ffc96"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "早霜晚雪，傷害禾麥。捐功棄力，飢無所食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fe17a8d4bb5bfe30728c5998c2349f83ce2dd594a83609f7fed3a866e1711419",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fce25627df957598f32ebe4e10f7cf9fdc0aca17c38587d64bbff99f8fe6181c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "蝠螺生子，深目黑醜。雖飾相就，眾人莫取。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:061be8e892fc0578533711f3f18c708b282cb47b2c5e058411bd607fdfda471f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cf4f04cd101123ba55a2c7e31f331854b6471af27d094db6761d56f0053a3f2b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "去如飛鴻，避凶直東。遂得全脫，與福相逢。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4dae4e8de92f76cf3dce0217d2617225a85e05c940c3e1c4ebc6b52b3d3f6ff9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f5b7103c3c467854cb07208e190b2e1dd184c56a9e3f06c6a1828827174b8e59"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "婚姻合配，同枕共牢。以降休嘉，子孫封侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2e09a391a690b90473402e8a48c8fa5565816b4e31e0180ea013e329b99b4a3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1fcb12cfea2363761be1ef04b36ec84b604d4ac7114a945822d10e4c34fd6b42"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "咸陽辰巳，長安戌亥。丘陵生止，非魚鰌市。不可避阻，終無悔咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f60a419d190940a4a86dafffd83ff73c5ee8baf4308084359fbe60997753370c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8a54aa900deb4d5f32477c767dd89cd303db398627baa991f9d0952d71f4555e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "螟蟲為賊，害我五穀。簞笥空虛，家無所食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e3bce71e824f28562779dae5c3c48a5f9928a066108f10a83fa2207bd7875246",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dedadbb00ef8562d9890ffe11766533bdb091440abbcffaa86c9475d02001eb7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "蒙恩拜德，東歸吾國。慷慨宴笑，歡樂有福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d289f65a59d100d460895a3c8e5078c340e1a2d6ceae099f3e80be0460622f68",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:971b354be6fafa5917c314698aa64ba851a09e2fafac8305155598b1b46be5cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "齎貝贖狸，不聽我辭。係於虎鬚，牽不得來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:886ca1efbc56f079ecfc25858bce317ab2d3ed6e40813a269ead5fa96c0284c6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5982eb8862132596f8ecb387c6cee657ef768699494a779aba25aa4cf8e64caf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "比目附翼，歡樂相得。行止集同，終不離忒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3edc86e50bd7755d236e89899a3159cdd2e9e2985b5aab7028251fc6683b07d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b682bc33ca2314f703a1b3e30bb362e865ad737d9762731c3f7172ff523e56d2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "一指食肉，口無所得。染其鼎鼐，舌饞於腹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e136c9cfa37e846148bc5d936b00ed2c67eef828e98bcf362feee90bd5ad5743",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c55cef463687194b2447a553c08b702ea149abc1f4a7e621f73036e89d7811ab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "曳綸汀洲，釣挂魴鯉。公孫得利，以享仲友。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6ce6d291f2c957c069fd008f7c8e27dd9ecde2a5fca6cf4dd69a925b25bda75f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:57d81e2f7ba3d9da99d7b8d5819238f6dab94199bb5dadd030d0497ea328e08b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "商紂牧野，顛敗所在。賦斂重數，黎元愁苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:35edb2ffbaa1343721a0e24185e6ab038d985f6533726f9667b99bfa5e593de5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c8e1058bbed50cae9dca3ab32109f308f3b10726a4fe8253209b6e065ebacc44"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "北辰紫宮，衣冠立中。含和達德，常受天福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:91518dd255c5754f3744557f2a0f022aafcfcc61c5a0132e207df74bc83ec792",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a3d320cd752fec606fe2e7e0724d592a8d68568260aa0ec684d57149f52924a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "輕戰尚勇，不知兵權。為敵所制，征師北奔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4c985a3573f153901f90ff01d31b95ced2bc7b68be30cb60a6e5bdde2eb5916f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b45b42b440ff9a6aa8f78d3c6edf8d882bf83dafc7a47210583cb39b39228ae2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "大口宣舌，神使伸言。黃龍景星，共應德門。興福上堂，天下安昌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d26c21948d1d7001fea329ffc93ac27625edc1ba13e467a31daee9a61601a499",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0d7f0619dc9cf6759ada0f77bebaf5048e9ab108d35779fe7aa6a2b6be4886d6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "凶子禍孫，把劍向門。凶訟觀囂，驚駭我家。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c5848bdcc2585e9271e300376f33c4c934aa5641231d6c66c19f7bd82d37e70c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf5b427c31ac3d3759738329025beb4e5000b5f264accb0138ab43fd8a94880a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "祝伯善言，能事鬼神。辭祈萬歲，使君延年。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b38924d6b2479c7b06ebac633fd1985762d54e5cf49812cee2312bf8585c41b6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b76c8d3dcdb53386f8f77700e61f18a10395d9cb9cc1cdd031c3bd6f49e99b7b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "珪璧琮璋，執贄見王。百里甯戚，應聘齊秦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0fdf8f9b0cfbcd74d813395b0cc7381ecbaabcadf7df17666f7d2e989961a6ba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d475a6c5b335f491d2294ef7a40d9685b59536c3d13c6d3ef039e0037e86a673"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "昧旦乘車，履危蹈溝。亡失裙襦，摧折兩軸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:81409b6ec95808ef81f3f4abdd9e8e72f8d674237deb771852f46d9bd693ec49",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0a6df55ad9c4d44cfba967b7067f82530450f88a398d89aa028b7bd85bd1c17e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "膠著未通，不出牛欄。斯饗羔羊，家室相安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cadb772ea0c2de64421c2380338534ffe92df915734baba08477b91bcd44c803",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:abeb4b014665c5c4b2741541f93df5a8961f15c7a1d0c8e9bdcb63f115889b38"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "卷舌遁世，仁德不舍。三聖攸同，周家茂興。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f02e987003a90d373de9dc7a4ba1fb0cfd5dd3e957e94bc4cc79d34b5a4de18",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f4ed55ba7f81a646262dd1edefdb79943c04bc5c06d34b87d2b7fce28f4911bf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "黍稷禾稼，垂秀方造。中旱不雨，傷風枯槁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:90a07adc5e99410fbd8c7e547c818d479e7e69e3c401162a2367fda7774c2e92",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6458c3c785e9139a61bd699f1de83816ab131e2363209f2ff55048b5e93ff58b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "冠帶南遊，與福喜期。邀於嘉徵，拜為公卿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f2f349e6657bc21d8eaff4b50e735b50eeab23e59327acbf2b9b91bc746d2e2e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a4185dafdc88508381d38c8cd701f3d980305d68df4ac115fc6c76453b9ee829"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "一巢九子，同公共母。柔順利貞，出入不殆。福祿所在。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1cea5367e15eeabcc901c3605a9017025e93739aaafffd3a8d9f7410f4c2e9c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:687de924330a8d3de0af71765f871862adafcb217ef561502ceeab42edfd1c2d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "韓氏長女，嫁於東海。多貌美好，宜家福壽。利得十倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47c24a5a32255263f8436392fb1ae29724e9b92b48a362646065815e11f47c37",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4ff307d9f2410805734b34af8554b296a71cf7c2891e9f44e4898fc3d96721d3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "因禍受福，喜盈我室。先人後己，所願必得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4e1c580a30d2421c16040d20fecdb858049b5d06d84cf5ef8081b11c5ba10860",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:96e76542746aad44707e677ea02732cdc3f033edcde02eedcde5f8e40716dc3f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "晉平有疾，迎醫秦國。病乃大祕，分為兩豎。逃匿肓上，伏於膏下。和不能愈。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d503173839476c7c9f5a5b5242498149c8c4f6c353df4ddeb960381ac8a00f4d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:140efbf56a1d6a2cc8f79d195381d05f015f5b3d1ae17f2dc368a1a471b3aa78"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "牡飛門啟，患憂大解。修福行善，不為身禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:195dae81003fb17616a8f5a27811515804d37537b65064d7fe2feb5f4a606de2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:702582760405e05b4305fd3f0af48f72d8ad43c25fda3a5dca3b34e707a6f3ae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "追亡逐北，呼還稚叔。至止而得，反其室廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e05cc87ea33de7a039aabf5ceda76616a670fc36c5502f8017e1b81161f0a32a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4cc6348552ada6ddd22b6453712041350bd4c43a538407152623041368ad191a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "鳥鳴葭端，一呼三顛。動搖東西，危慄不安。疾病無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:67f9ef549b5f00a702c52fec4d54d03eb95d97019a413f675ed627820390a774",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b64b924dd275c277f7d6eb48e25b0014070c3891b5965d57a9bb948a5cc39472"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "龍化為虎，泰山之陽。眾多從者，莫敢救藏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4878320e459c9e79d28f6af4cfda482c1405ed8ec59605e9ef74efe3c5b22df0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:54dcc205afeb95110d3e30dfb20f4f24f5d8e5bb04d79f1c208ee71d04ae0d75"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "焱風忽起，車馳竭竭。棄名追亡，失其和節。憂心惙惙。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ad054b0b1a24f6264ab691f94e522ef7d6f8dd854d0ac714e3560c554bd4229",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:64f2181771034c06cbb93a16b6a1becf638e397f79a85c31d9cee459b665f6d7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "遊居石門，祿安身全。受福西鄰，歸飲玉泉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f6229b7082c655d8586cd0278e34ba126965550b5d22b5798b836b7d87cfdd6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:941393859e71b69e24d12f685b8a76651401988d3c77bb9a59f434ffdc1f7e8a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 5,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "登高上山，見王自言。申理我冤，得職蒙恩。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9d274838aca1a4d81c3b24a1e6160400d604f44234ef6275ada920d764d22d76",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:291dfb3fe95427a7b2fc58594872d47c921526cef40bb42734c5640232e728d4"
    }
  ]
}
